## ✨ Features

### Grid Controls
✅ **Grid Size Slider** - 20-400px (in performance overlay)  
✅ **Ctrl+Wheel Zoom** - Resize grid cells (20-400px)  
✅ **Starts at 20px** - Tiny cells by default  
✅ **Dynamic Layout** - Grid adapts to zoom level  

### Image Quality
✅ **Thumbnail Resolution Slider** - 128-512px decode quality  
✅ **Separate from Grid Size** - Grid = UI zoom, Thumb = image quality  

### Performance Controls (Right Sidebar)
✅ **Grid Size (UI Zoom)** - 20-400px slider + Ctrl+Wheel  
✅ **Thumb Resolution (Quality)** - 128-512px slider  
✅ **Viewport Culling Toggle** - Only loads visible items  
✅ **Frame Budget Toggle** - Limits uploads per frame  
✅ **Frame Budget Slider** - 1-50 uploads/frame  
✅ **FPS Monitor** - Color-coded real-time  
✅ **Queue Depth** - Pending decode count  
✅ **Memory Usage** - Live MB counter  

